UID:2yBMqc4GRvZShjMHdGJXF
SUMMARY:Hands-On Workshop: Build Your Own Reusable AI System
DTSTAMP:20260811T095928Z
DTSTART:20260814T083000Z
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/hands-on-workshop-b
	uild-your-own-reusable-ai-system-tickets-1995123296487?aff=oddtdtcreator \
	nMost AI advice focuses on clever prompts. This workshop gives you a solid
	 tool you will use again and again. \nAt this month’s Social Media Breakfa
	st Houston\, Kami Huyse and Jennifer Texada will show you how to stop star
	ting from scratch every time you sit down with AI. In the first half hour\
	, they’ll break down what a Smart Card is and why it turns scattered promp
	ting into a repeatable system. \nThen it’s build time! \nYou’ll build one 
	yourself\, live\, with guidance every step of the way. You’ll leave with a
	 working Smart Card built for your own work\, ready to use right away with
	 the AI tool of your choice. \nChoose to create a tool that will help you 
	build your monthly newsletter\, proposals\, client reports\, a press relea
	se\, or something else you do regularly and would like a repeatable proces
	s to help with. \nThis session is hands-on. \nBring a laptop and an AI too
	l that lets you upload files\, such as ChatGPT\, Claude\, Gemini\, or Micr
	osoft Copilot. We’ll walk through how to start a project on ChatGPT\, Clau
	de\, or Gemini. Bring a real task you want AI to help with. \nWhat you wil
	l learn: \nHow to spot and create a repeatable process you can hand off to
	 AI.\nWhat AI should do and what humans should keep control of.\nHow to or
	ganize your data and content so you aren’t trapped in one tool.\nWhy it’s 
	worth creating a reusable Project\, GPT\, or Gem instead of starting over 
	each time.\nWhen it makes sense to use the desktop version of your AI tool
	.\nHow to set up a project in ChatGPT\, Claude\, or Gemini so your Smart C
	ard is ready to use.\n\nhttps://iondistrict.com/event/hands-on-workshop-bu
	ild-your-own-reusable-ai-system/\n\nFrom Ion District
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/hands-on-workshop-build-your-own-reusable
	-ai-system/
LOCATION:Ion\, 4201 Main Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ion-district
CATEGORIES:Ion District
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
