DESCRIPTION:We’re celebrating 2 years of serves\, smashes\, and community a
	t Pickle Lab\, and you’re invited to join the fun!\n\nSwing by on Thursday
	\, August 20 from 6 – 9 PM for an evening of open play pickleball (paddles
	 are available to borrow)\, beats by a live DJ\, MADabolic demonstrations\
	, a variety of giveaways and swag\, and complimentary samples from White C
	law Zero. Enjoy a free beverage courtesy of Second Draught\, and food will
	 be available for purchase from local food truck\, Crunchy’s for the Munch
	ies.\n\nThis event is free to attend\, but RSVPs are encouraged.\n\nhttps:
	//iondistrict.com/event/pickle-labs-two-year-anniversary-celebration/\n\nF
	rom Ion District
