SUMMARY:Sound Bath with Daemein Smith (Prioritizing Peace)
DTSTAMP:20260811T095928Z
DTSTART:20260912T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a peaceful morning experience in Hermann Park with 
	a free guided Sound Bath led by Daemein Smith of Prioritizing Peace. Set a
	gainst the natural beauty of the Tsuru Family Terrace in the Commons\, thi
	s immersive meditation experience uses sound and vibration to promote rela
	xation\, mindfulness\, and emotional well-being. Guests are encouraged to 
	slow down\, reset\, and “Prioritize Peace” through a calming journey of so
	und healing in nature. \n Tsuru Family Terrace\n Saturday\, September 12\n
	 8 – 9 a.m.\n Free Community Session \nGuests are encouraged to bring a yo
	ga mat if available. Blankets and pillows are also recommended for additio
	nal comfort. All ages and experience levels welcome. \nParking: Free parki
	ng available across the street from the Commons in Lot S (6215 Main St\, H
	ouston\, TX 77030). Additional street parking available along Main Street.
	\n\nhttps://hermannpark.org/event/sound-bath-with-daemein-smith-prioritizi
	ng-peace-12/\n\nFrom Hermann Park Conservancy
URL:https://hermannpark.org/event/sound-bath-with-daemein-smith-prioritizin
	g-peace-12/
LOCATION:The Commons
