IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-
 content/uploads/2026/08/Launch-Kit-Houston-Pop-Culture-Market-I.png
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08
 /Launch-Kit-Houston-Pop-Culture-Market-I.png
UID:hizqV7Le3u0VTQy51EDn0
SUMMARY:Houston Pop Culture Market I
DTSTAMP:20260811T095928Z
DTSTART:20261018T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:Houston Pop Culture Market – The Place to Collect Your Fandom.\
	nBuild your dream collection at Houston Pop Culture Market\, a one-day mar
	ketplace for toys\, comics\, anime collectibles\, gaming memorabilia\, art
	work\, figures\, and pop culture collectibles. Explore a full floor of tru
	sted vendors bringing fan-favorite finds\, rare collectibles\, vintage tre
	asures\, and unique items from across every fandom. Everything from action
	 figures and anime merchandise to retro gaming\, comic books\, collectible
	s\, and nostalgic favorites all in one place! \n  \n📅 Sunday\, October 18\
	, 2026 | 10AM–5PM \n📍 9700 Bissonnet St #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n🎟 FRE
	E Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🔥 Event Highlights 🔥\n🛍️ What’s Waiting on the
	 Floor\nFind your fandom essentials at booths stacked with full collection
	s of pop-culture inventory from every fandom. Your era. Your favorite char
	acter. The grail that got away. It’s all happening in Houston.  Anime\, re
	tro games\, toys\, action figures\, DVDs\, TCG\, Funkos\, and more. \n  \n
	🤝 Shop\, Trade\, and Connect\nConnect with vendors as into pop culture as 
	you are. Make trades and have a great conversation at the tables about the
	 genres you both love and the rare items you’re searching for. \n  \n💼 Tab
	les Available\nGet in on the ground floor. Literally. Bring your pop cultu
	re collection and join us as a vendor for Houston Pop Culture Market I. \n
	👉 Apply here \nOne floor. Everything you’re into. Houston Pop Culture Mark
	et I launches Sunday\, October 18.\n\nhttps://ccs-houston.com/events/houst
	on-pop-culture-market-i/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-pop-culture-market-i/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT7H
END:VEVENT
